---
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<figure class="verification-example"><div class="field-marker">What to look for · Sample data</div>
{(["light","dark"] as const).map(theme=><a class={`verification-${theme}`} href={`${base}product-tour/session-detail-${theme}.png`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Open full-size recorded session screenshot"><picture><source media="(max-width:640px)" srcset={`${base}product-tour/session-detail-mobile-${theme}.png`} width="394" height="500" /><img src={`${base}product-tour/session-detail-${theme}.png`} width="1120" height="760" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Actual Lore app showing a recorded webhook session and its conversation" /></picture></a>)}
<figcaption>A recorded conversation in the local Lore app. Open the Dashboard URL printed by your own gateway; this public website cannot check its connection. <span>Select the image to open the original full-size capture.</span></figcaption></figure>
<style is:global>
.verification-example { margin-block:1.25rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-control);overflow:hidden;background:var(--surface); }
.verification-example > .field-marker { padding:.75rem 1rem; }.verification-example img { display:block;width:100%;height:auto; }.verification-example figcaption { padding:.75rem 1rem;font-size:.8125rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted); }.verification-example figcaption span { display:block;margin-top:6px; }.verification-example a { display:block; }.verification-example a:focus-visible { outline-offset:-4px; }.verification-dark { display:none!important; }:root[data-theme="dark"] .verification-light { display:none!important; }:root[data-theme="dark"] .verification-dark { display:block!important; }
</style>
